Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:17.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我在玩性虐待吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you find me sadistic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:21.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 小乖...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Kiddo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:23.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'd like to believe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.97,0:00:27.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即使现在你还是很清醒...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're aware enough, even now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:31.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我不是在和你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... to know that there's nothing sadistic...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:33.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玩性虐待的游戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in my actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.92,0:00:38.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,此时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this moment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:41.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this is me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:43.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最痛苦的时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...at my most masochistic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:46.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.49,0:00:47.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的骨肉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your ba...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:54.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我像是死了 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looked dead, didn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:56.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我没死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I wasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:01:00.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起码我可以说 我是千辛万苦 才捡回这条命的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it wasn't from lack of trying, I can tell you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.21,0:01:03.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上比尔最后一枪 使我陷入昏迷状态...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, Bill's last bullet put me in a coma ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:06.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一场长达四年的昏迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a coma I was to lie in for four years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:11.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我苏醒之后 就开始了 像电影广告词似的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I woke up, I went on what the movie advertisements refer to as{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:15.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"怒吼疯狂之复仇"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"a roaring rampage of revenge."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.62,0:01:18.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怒吼 我疯狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I roared, and I rampaged,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.73,0:01:22.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也得到了血腥的满足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I got bloody satisfaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.36,0:01:26.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止 我已经宰了不少人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've killed a hell of a lot of people to get to this point,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.27,0:01:29.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是还剩一个没杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've only one more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:31.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最后的一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.74,0:01:35.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是现在我开车去找的这个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one I'm driving to right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:38.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一剩下的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only one left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.25,0:01:41.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等我到了那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when I arrive at my destination,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.98,0:01:45.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我将会...杀死比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am gonna kill Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.95,0:01:52.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《杀死比尔：第二卷》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:07.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,[第六章：双松镇大屠杀]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.51,0:02:13.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,双松镇结婚教堂发生的案子...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The incident that happened at the Two Pines Wedding Chapel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.01,0:02:17.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是这个故事的起因...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that put this whole gory story into motion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:19.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经成为一个传奇故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has since become legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:22.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"双松镇大屠杀"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Massacre at Two Pines. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:24.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,报纸上是这么称呼它的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what the newspapers called it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:26.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而当地电视台称之为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The local TV news called it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.69,0:02:30.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"德州艾帕索市婚礼教堂之惨案"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The El Paso, Texas Wedding Chapel Massacre. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.76,0:02:33.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么发生的 有谁在场...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How it happened, who was there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:36.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死了多少人 是谁杀的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how many got killed and who killed them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:40.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,众说纷纭 莫衷一是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}changes depending on who's telling the story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:45.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 惨案根本不是发生在婚礼上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In actual fact, the massacre didn't happen during a wedding at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:48.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而是婚礼之前的彩排上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a wedding rehearsal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.15,0:02:50.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彩排到牧师对新郎说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, when we come to the part where I say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:55.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"你现在可以吻新娘" 你现在可以吻新娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You may kiss the bride," you may kiss the bride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:57.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过别把舌头伸进她嘴巴里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't stick your tongue in her mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:01.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你朋友们或许会觉得很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This might be funny to your friends,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:04.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是会让你父母难堪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it would be embarrassing to your parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:09.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会控制自己的 牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll try to restrain ourselves, Reverend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们想好要用哪支曲子了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Y'all got a song?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.41,0:03:19.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"温柔地爱我"如何? 这首歌我会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How 'bout "Love Me Tender"? I can play that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:21.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好啊 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sure. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:24.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"温柔地爱我" 这曲子很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Love Me Tender" would be great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:27.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如弗斯...就是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rufus, he's the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.45,0:03:30.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如弗斯...你当初是替谁伴奏来着?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rufus, who was that that you used to play for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.59,0:03:32.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如弗斯·汤玛斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rufus Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:35.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如弗斯·汤玛斯 如弗斯·汤玛斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rufus Thomas. Rufus Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:39.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾加入"哲欧"、"流浪着"和"游走"乐团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a Drell. I was a Drifter. I was a Coaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:43.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也曾是"街头小子" 和"巴可"的一份子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was part of the Gang. I was a Barkay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:47.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要他们来德州 我就和他们一起演奏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they come through Texas, I done played with 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.98,0:03:51.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如弗斯...就是你啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rufus, he's the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:56.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我还忘了什么吗? - 我想想...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have I forgotten anything? - Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:04:00.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯...哦...对了... 你忘了安排坐位了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes, you forgot, uh, the seating arrangements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.35,0:04:03.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢你 老妈 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, Mother. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:05.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,按照我们的惯例...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the way we normally do this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:09.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有新娘这一边 还有新郎这一边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have the bride's side, and then we have the groom's side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:12.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过新娘这边没人出席{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But since the bride ain't got nobody comin',{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.87,0:04:16.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而新郎这边又有太多人要来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the groom's got far too many people comin'...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.87,0:04:20.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对呀 还有人大老远 从奥克拉荷马州来呢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yeah, they're comin' all the way from Oklahoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.61,0:04:23.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对呀...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:26.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么...我觉得可以...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't see no problem with...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:29.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让新郎这边的人 也去坐到新娘那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the groom's side sharing the bride's side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.55,0:04:32.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说呢 老妈? - 我不反对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you, Mother? - I don't have a problem with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:34.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:38.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 如果你那边 也有人来就更好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, you know, it would be good if you had somebody come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:40.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这表示...他们也祝福你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, as a sign of good faith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:44.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是 我真的没有亲朋好友...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't have anybody...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.03,0:04:48.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了汤米和这些朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...except for Tommy and my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:53.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 连家人都没有吗? - 嗯...很快就会有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have no family? - Well, I'm workin' on changing that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:58.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈蒙尼太太 我们就是 这位天使需要的所有的人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Harmony, we're all the family this little angel's ever gonna need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.61,0:05:03.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有点不舒服 肚里的小ㄚ头让我很难受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not feeling very well, and this bitch is starting to piss me off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:07.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们继续聊 我出去透口气儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So while y'all blather on, I'm gonna go outside and get some air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:10.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了...牧师...对不起...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Um, uh, Reverend, sorry, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:13.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她要出去透透气儿 - 是的 以她现在的身体状况 ...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's gonna go out and get some air. - Yeah. Given her delicate condition...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.03,0:05:16.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几分钟就好 她没事儿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She just needs a few minutes to get it together. She'll be OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:18.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:37.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈啰 小乖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:47.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是怎么找到我的? - 这还用说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did you find me? - I'm the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:54.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这儿干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doin' here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.39,0:06:56.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I doin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:07:00.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:03.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才在吹箫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...moment ago I was playin' my flute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:12.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this moment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:17.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这双老眼正看着 我所见过最迷人的新娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm lookin' at the most beautiful bride these old eyes have ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:22.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你为什么会在这儿? - 看你最后一眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you here? - Last look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:29.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会好好的吗? - 我这辈子从来没做过好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you gonna be nice? - I've never been nice in my whole life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:34.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我会尽量表现出...和善{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll do my best to be sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:36.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:39.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我总是告诉你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always told you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:42.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和善的一面是你最好的一面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your sweet side is you best side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:47.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这大概就是为什么 你是唯一见过我和善面的人吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess that's why you're the only one who's ever seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:53.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 瞧...你已经大腹便便了 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you got a bun in the oven. - Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:58.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我怀孕了 - 哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm knocked up. - Jeez, Louise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:05.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的那个小伙子还真不浪费时间啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That young man of yours sure doesn't believe in wasting time, does he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:07.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你见过汤米没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen Tommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:13.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那个穿燕尾礼服的吗? - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Big guy in the tux? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.27,0:08:15.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我见过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:18.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我挺喜欢他的发型{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like his hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.01,0:08:22.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你答应过要好好的喔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised you'd be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:28.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过会尽力而为 算不上是承诺吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I said I'd do my best. That's hardly a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:31.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:34.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你未来的夫婿是干哪行的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does your young man do for a living?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.33,0:08:39.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在艾帕索这儿 开了家二手唱片行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He owns a used record store here in El Paso.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:44.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喔...是音乐爱好者 对吧? - 他热爱音乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah. Music lover, eh? - He's fond of music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:47.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也是啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't we all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.01,0:08:54.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你最近干什么活儿维生呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what are you doing for a J-O-B these days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:59.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在唱片行里打工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work in the record store.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:02.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊...原来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aso.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:06.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,突然间一切都清楚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It all suddenly seems so clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.56,0:09:12.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你喜欢那份工作吗? - 嗯 我非常喜欢 你这聪明鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you like it? - Yeah. I like it a lot, smartass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:16.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以成天听音乐...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get to listen to music all day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:20.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,聊音乐 真的酷得很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...talk about music all day. It's really cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:25.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我的小女儿来说 这是个合适的成长环境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be a great environment for my little girl to grow up in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:37.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是拿那种刀头舐血 杀人掳掠的活儿来比吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As opposed to jetting around the world, killing human beings, and being paid vast sums of money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:39.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:42.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 老朋友...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my old friend...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:44.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们各走各的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to each his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:49.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 先把琐事放一边...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, all cockblockery aside...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.37,0:09:52.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常期待见见那小伙子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am looking forward to meeting your young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:58.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我其实很在意我的女人 到底嫁给了谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I happen to be, more or less, particular whom my gal marries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:04.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你也要来参加婚礼吗? - 除非能安排我坐在新娘这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want to come to the wedding? - Only if I can sit on the bride's side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.22,0:10:08.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会发现我这边有点冷清的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find it a bit lonely on my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.72,0:10:12.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你身边一向很冷清{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your side always was a bit lonely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:15.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不会坐其它地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I wouldn't sit anywhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:19.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:22.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我昨晚有个美梦 梦到了你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I had the loveliest dream about you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:24.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 汤米过来了! 记得叫我爱琳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, here's Tommy! Call me Arlene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:27.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你一定是汤米! - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You must be Tommy! - Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:29.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爱琳跟我说了很多关于你的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arlene's told me so much about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:32.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 宝贝 你没事吧? - 哦 我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey, you OK? - Oh, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.55,0:10:35.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米 让我来介绍我父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy, I'd like you to meet my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.72,0:10:38.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 老天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:40.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 老天! 真是太好了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, this is great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.35,0:10:43.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真高兴认识你 先生 哦...不对...爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so glad to meet you, sir... uh, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:45.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The name's Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:47.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 真高兴能认识你 比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's great to meet you... Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.99,0:10:51.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 爱琳跟我说你不能来 - 给你个惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Arlene told me you couldn't make it. - Surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:54.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我老爸就是这样 总是出人意料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my pop for ya. Always full of surprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:58.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错啦 说到"出人意料"...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, in the surprise department...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:11:01.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是有其父必有其女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the apple doesn't fall far from the tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:03.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你什么时候到的? - 刚到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When did you get in? - Just now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.81,0:11:06.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 直接从澳大利亚来? - 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you come straight from Australia? - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:10.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸 我告诉汤米 你在澳洲挖银矿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy, I told Tommy that you were in Perth mining for silver, and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:12.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人找得到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...no one could reach you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:16.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很幸运的是 这次不一样啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky for us all, that's not the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:18.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.53,0:11:22.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这是干嘛呢? 我只听过平装彩排{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this all about? I've heard of wedding rehearsals,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:26.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但不曾听说盛装彩排{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't believe I've ever heard of a wedding dress rehearsal before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:28.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.07,0:11:31.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,婚纱礼服这么贵 只穿一次太可惜了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Why pay so much money for a dress you're only gonna wear once?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:34.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特别是爱琳穿上它 是如此的美丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially when Arlene looks so goddamn beautiful in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:38.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们打算物尽其用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I think we're gonna try to get all the mileage we can out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:45.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是说...新郎在婚礼前 看到新娘穿礼服是不好的预兆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it supposed to be bad luck for the groom to see the bride in her wedding dress before the ceremony?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:50.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是想 活着就该经历些风浪吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess I just believe in living dangerously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:54.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我恰巧懂你的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know just what you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:57.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子 有些人还有事呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son. Some of us have places to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:59.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.37,0:12:03.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还得再排练一次 还是请你去坐...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we got to go through this one more time. So, why don't you have a s...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:07.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天哪 我是怎么啦? 你应该牵着新娘进场才对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. What am I thinking? You should give her away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:11.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米 爹地不太喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tommy, that's not exactly Daddy's cup of tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:14.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他还是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Father would be much more comfortable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:17.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 和其他来宾坐一起会比较自在 - 哦 真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- sitting with the rest of the guests. - Hmm. Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.35,0:12:19.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要求是过分了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's asking a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:23.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 好吧 那就算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. OK. Well, forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:26.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那今晚吃个饭庆祝一下如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how about we go out to dinner tonight to celebrate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.53,0:12:29.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我请客才行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only on the condition that I pay for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:31.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说定了 我们得彩排了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deal. We got to do this now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:35.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我能观礼吗? - 当然 请坐吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I watch? - Absolutely. Have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:39.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 新娘席在哪边? - 就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which is the bride's side? - Right over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,新郎的妈 开始吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother, here we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:49.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 孩子 关于誓言的部分...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now son, about them vows...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:58.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.29,0:13:02.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我只想... - 你不欠我什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I just want... - You don't owe me a damn thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:05.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他就是你要的男人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he's the man you want...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:08.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就去他身边吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then go stand by him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:35.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我漂亮吗? - 哦 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do I look pretty? - Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:49.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:25.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼呀?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.65,0:14:28.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要! 比尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Bill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:13.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说她杀了88个保镳 才杀到尾连面前?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tellin' me she cut her way through 88 bodyguards before she got to O-Ren?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:16.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是刚好88人啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, there wasn't really 88 of 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:18.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们只是自称"疯狂88人帮"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just called themselves "The Crazy 88"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:21.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么? - 我怎知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How come? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:24.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们觉得这名号很酷吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess they thought it sounded cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.47,0:15:28.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那他们是怎么死在她的半藏刀下?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyhow, they all fell under her Hanzo sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.17,0:15:32.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她有把半藏刀? - 他铸了一把给她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She got a Hanzo sword? - He made one for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:35.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是发过毒誓不再铸刀了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't he swear a blood oath to never make another sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.15,0:15:39.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,似乎他破了誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would appear he has broken it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:45.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,日本鬼子不是很记仇的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Them Japs sure know how to hold a grudge, don't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:49.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:52.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会让人想起旧仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you just tend to bring that out in people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.93,0:15:57.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恕我冒昧的问个蠢问题...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this is a ridiculous question before I ask it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:16:02.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你刀上的功夫还没落下吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you haven't, by any chance, kept up with your... swordplay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:06.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我 呃...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:10.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几年前我就把刀当掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pawned that years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:13.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把服部半藏的刀当了!?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hocked a Hattori Hanzo sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:16.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是无价之宝啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was priceless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:27.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在艾帕索算不上什么宝啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not in El Paso, it ain't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:30.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在艾帕索当了250块钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In El Paso, I got me $250 for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.91,0:16:35.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在上空舞厅当保镳 比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a bouncer in a titty bar, Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.91,0:16:43.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她想动手 只要去那儿 随便找个茬 咱们就能打起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she wants to fight with me, all she's got to do is come down to the club and start some shit, and we'll be in a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:50.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们很久没聊聊了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know we haven't spoken in some time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.26,0:16:54.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次聊天也闹的不愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the last time we spoke wasn't the most pleasant,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:58.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你不能再生我的气了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you've got to get over being mad at me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.63,0:17:00.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,得开始担心(消音)了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and start becoming afraid of (bleep),{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:04.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为她要来找你 她来是要你的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because she is coming, and she's coming to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:10.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有我的帮助 她一定成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And unless you accept my assistance, I have no doubt she will succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:23.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会逃避我的罪过 也不会逃避我应得的报应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't dodge guilt, and I don't Jew out of paying my comeuppance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:29.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们难道不能忘掉往事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't we just... forget the past?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:34.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That woman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:37.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是应该报仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...deserves her revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.57,0:17:43.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:46.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也的确该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we deserve to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:53.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 换句话说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then again...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:55.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她也该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so does she.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:18:01.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I guess...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.73,0:18:04.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们走着瞧吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we'll just see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:08.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,行吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:16.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,[第七章：宝拉休兹的孤坟]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:45.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Late again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.57,0:18:48.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴德 你没时间观念吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Budd, can't you tell time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:50.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 还没人上门呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There ain't nobody in here, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.74,0:18:53.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是巴德? - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that Budd? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.15,0:18:56.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫他给我滚过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him to get his fucking ass back here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:58.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.15,0:19:02.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴德 赖瑞有话跟你说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Budd, Larry'd like a word with ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.39,0:19:08.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吸一口 你就浑然忘我了 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a hit. Be somebody, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:20.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你找我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You looking for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:30.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你以前 在哪家洗车厂打工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what car wash you worked before you came here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:33.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迟到20分钟还让你大摇大摆的进来 不过肯定不是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that let you stroll in 20 minutes late, but it wasn't owned by me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:36.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不过我真他妈的有间家洗车厂 - 要我回避吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and I own a fuckin' car wash. - Do you want me to leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:39.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 别走 我要你坐着等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't want you to leave. I want you to sit and wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:41.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞赖...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Larry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:44.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外面没有客人 所以...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there ain't nobody out there, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:50.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"外面没有客人 赖瑞 "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"There's nobody out there, Larry."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:52.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想说啥?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.74,0:19:57.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这儿用不着你了? - 我是说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That you're not needed here? - My point is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.41,0:20:02.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说...我是个保镳 而现在外面又没人闹事啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm the bouncer, and there ain't nobody out there to bounce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.12,0:20:05.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saying that the reason...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.42,0:20:13.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没干我付钱给你干的活儿 是因为没活可干?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that you're not doing the job that I'm... paying you to do is that you don't have a job to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:18.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不是... - 你是这个意思吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No... - Is that what you're saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:20.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想要我相信什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you trying to convince me of, exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:24.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信你像这里的屁眼一样 是个没用的废物吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you're as useless as an asshole right here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:26.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜我怎么想 老兄?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, guess what, buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:32.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的 我还真的被你说服了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think... you just fucking convinced me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:34.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们看看日历吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go to the calendar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.45,0:20:36.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看日历咯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's calendar time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.78,0:20:39.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看巴德的值班表喔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calendar time for Buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:42.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好 你明天有班吗? - 有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- OK. You working tomorrow? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:46.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 你明天没班 你根本不知道哪天有班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm. No, you're n... You don't even know what fucking day you work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:48.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看这儿 明天你没班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. You're not working tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:52.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,周三才有 这儿 看到了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're working Wednesday. Here you are. There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.37,0:20:54.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 周四有班吗? - 有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Workin' Thursday? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:58.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说没有 星期五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so. Friday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:00.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说...这有你的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I d... There's your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:03.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说了算 - 这里以前有你的名字 懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If you say so. - There used to be your name. OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:06.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 星期六 以前有你的名字 - 哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Saturday. There used to be your name. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.95,0:21:08.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 星期一...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Monday...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.05,0:21:10.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧 这样如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. How about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:15.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在的年轻人只认得钱 其他什么都不懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuckin' with your cash is the only thing you kids seem to understand. OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:19.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在回家等我打电话给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I want you to go home till I call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.16,0:21:21.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等我打给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Till I call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.59,0:21:25.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走之前去找洛姬 她有事情给你做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you leave, talk to Rocket. She's got a job for you to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.10,0:21:29.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:32.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:34.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个蠢帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That fuckin' hat.{\r}
