Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.90,0:40:56.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和尚真正的意思无从得知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The motives of the monk remain unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.90,0:40:58.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一知道的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is known...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.07,0:41:01.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...were the consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.82,0:41:19.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第二天早上白眉来到了少林寺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next morning, Pai Mei appeared at the Shaolin temple...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.06,0:41:23.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要求掌门方丈...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and demanded of the temple's head abbot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.40,0:41:28.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自刎谢罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he offer Pai Mei his neck to repay the insult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.17,0:41:34.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起先方丈想安抚他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The abbot, at first, tried to console Pai Mei.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.61,0:41:38.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,却发现白眉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only to find Pai Mei was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.58,0:41:40.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难消怒气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...inconsolable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.56,0:41:53.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So began...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.06,0:42:03.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,白莲教就血洗少林 全寺60僧众无一幸免{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the Massacre of the Shaolin Temple, and all sixty of the monks inside, at the fists of the White Lotus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.54,0:42:07.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后...传说从此开始...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And... so began the legend...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.41,0:42:11.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,白眉的五指穿心掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of Pai Mei's Five-Point-Palm Exploding-Heart Technique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.88,0:42:14.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五指穿心掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what, pray tell, is the Five-Point-Palm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.18,0:42:16.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 到底是啥? - 非常简单...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Exploding-Heart Technique? - Quite simply,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.58,0:42:21.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,武学中最致命的一招{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the deadliest blow in all of martial arts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.39,0:42:26.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他以五指击你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hits you with his fingertips...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.03,0:42:30.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五指不等的内力击在你身上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...at five different pressure points on your body...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.03,0:42:35.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后让你自己逃走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and then lets you walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.13,0:42:38.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你在五步之内...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But once you've taken five steps...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.17,0:42:42.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,穿心...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your heart explodes inside your body...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.27,0:42:45.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,倒地而死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you fall to the floor, dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.51,0:42:48.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他把这招传给你了吗 - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did he teach you that? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.58,0:42:54.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的五指穿心掌从不传人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He teaches no one the Five-Point-Palm Exploding-Heart Technique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.65,0:42:57.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说到这儿...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.06,0:43:01.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢你的一点就是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one of the things I've always liked about you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.46,0:43:03.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小乖...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Kiddo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.73,0:43:07.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来比实际的年龄更聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is you appear wise beyond your years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.57,0:43:16.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我给你这聪明人一点忠告:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, allow me to impart a word to the wise:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.27,0:43:17.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.98,0:43:21.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管白眉说什么 你都得服从{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whatever Pai Mei says, obey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.35,0:43:28.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即使你短暂地露出些许不敬的眼神 他立刻把你眼珠子挖出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you flash him, even for an instant, a defiant eye, he'll pluck it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.22,0:43:33.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你的美式骄傲触怒了他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you throw any American sass his way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.86,0:43:37.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他会把你脊椎 和脖子像小树枝一般地劈断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he'll snap your back and your neck like they were twigs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.50,0:43:43.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就成为一个故事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that will be the story of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.59,0:44:06.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他答应收你为徒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll accept you as his student.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.22,0:44:08.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么啦? - 没事儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to you? - Nothin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.39,0:44:11.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 和他动手了? - 朋友间过个招罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get in a fight? - Friendly contest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.63,0:44:13.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么会答应收我的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did he accept me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.13,0:44:17.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他已经很老很老了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he's a very, very, very old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.47,0:44:20.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和其他老不死的王八蛋一样...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And like all rotten bastards...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.77,0:44:25.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他愈老就愈寂寞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when they become old, they get lonely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.01,0:44:28.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,年纪改不了他的脾气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which has no effect on their dispositions,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.05,0:44:33.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但也让他学到了 有个伴儿的重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it does teach them the value of company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.85,0:44:36.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whew. Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.42,0:44:41.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,光是瞧这些台阶 我腿就软了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just seein' those steps again makes me ache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.96,0:44:47.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以后你挑着水桶上上下下的 可有你乐的啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have a lot of fun carrying buckets of water up and down that fucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.74,0:44:53.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我何时能再见到你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When will I see you again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.87,0:44:57.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我最喜欢的70年代 一首黑人灵歌的歌名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the title of my favorite soul song of the seventies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.44,0:44:59.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 啥? - 没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Nothin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.31,0:45:01.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等他说你可以出师时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he tells me you're done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.85,0:45:04.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想会是何时?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When do you think that might be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.62,0:45:07.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 那全看你自己了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That, my dearest, depends entirely on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.62,0:45:11.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住 切勿讥讽 切勿顶撞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now remember, no sarcasm, no backtalk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.32,0:45:13.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起码头一两年里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least not for the first year or so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.69,0:45:16.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得给他时间来 慢慢让你进入状况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have to let him warm up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.96,0:45:20.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他讨厌白人 藐视美国人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hates Caucasians, despises Americans,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.87,0:45:23.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更不喜欢女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and has nothing but contempt for women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.04,0:45:29.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以像你这种情行 得多花点儿时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So in your case... it might take a little while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.44,0:45:33.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adios.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.48,0:47:13.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,师父...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.41,0:47:17.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的汉语好差{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Mandarin is lousy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.11,0:47:21.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一个字也听不懂 而且好刺耳!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It causes my ears discomfort. You bray like an ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.92,0:47:24.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没要你说话 你就别说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not to speak unless spoken to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.96,0:47:28.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的汉语好呢 还是你的广东话好?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it too much to hope, you understand Cantonese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.30,0:47:33.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的日语很好...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I speak Japanese very well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.77,0:47:37.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没问你日本话 也没问你蒙古话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't ask if you speak Japanese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.14,0:47:39.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我问你会不会说广东话?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked if you understand Cantonese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.84,0:47:41.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一点点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.51,0:47:47.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是来学武的 不是学讲话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are here to learn the mysteries of Kung Fu, not linguistics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.51,0:47:49.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不懂汉语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can't understand me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.68,0:47:51.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像狗一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will communicate with you like I would a dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.48,0:47:54.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会斥喝你 命令你 用棍打你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I yell, when I point, when I beat you with my stick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.06,0:48:02.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的师父是不是比尔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill is your master, is he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.83,0:48:06.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.67,0:48:12.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你师傅说过你曾经学过武术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your master tells me, you're not entirely unschooled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.40,0:48:14.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你学过些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What training do you possess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.67,0:48:18.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我精通虎鹤拳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am proficient in Tiger-Crane Style,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.34,0:48:22.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更精通日本武士道剑术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I am more than proficient in the exquisite art of the Samurai sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.71,0:48:26.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哼 日本剑道 开什么玩笑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The exquisite art of the Samurai sword. Don't make me laugh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.75,0:48:31.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你所谓的剑道不值个屁 你就更加笨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your so-called exquisite art, is only fit for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.39,0:48:33.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然敢正视我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Japanese fat heads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.43,0:48:43.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看你的脾气都可以学武 你觉得本道的功夫跟你比如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your anger amuses me. Do you believe you are my match?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.10,0:48:44.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.54,0:48:47.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道本道会杀人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you aware I kill at will?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.17,0:48:49.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.74,0:48:51.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你是想死啰?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it your wish to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.54,0:48:51.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.08,0:48:55.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you must be stupid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.85,0:48:57.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you must be stupid...so stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.52,0:49:01.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本道好想看看你有多傻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rise, and let me look at your ridiculous face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.75,0:49:02.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.46,0:49:13.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亏你还学过虎鹤拳 刚才走了一百来台阶就在喘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So my pathetic friend... Is there anything that you can do well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.93,0:49:15.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看你不单是傻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.30,0:49:18.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,身体也很虚啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cat got your tongue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.70,0:49:22.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 对了 你会说日本话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes, you speak Japanese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.31,0:49:24.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我最恨日本人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I despise the Goddamn Japs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.78,0:49:29.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去兵器架那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to that rack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.82,0:49:38.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拔那把剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remove the sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.12,0:50:06.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要看下你的武功有多深{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see how good you really are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.79,0:50:09.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出招{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.09,0:50:11.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我输给你的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you land a single blow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.52,0:50:15.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我干脆拜你为师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bow down and call you master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.51,0:50:31.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到我的功夫了吧 试我的脚法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From here you can get an excellent view of my foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.15,0:50:40.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的剑术...只是一般入门的水平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your swordsmanship is amateur at best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.63,0:50:57.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,残废也比你强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your so-called kung-fu, is really, quite pathetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.83,0:50:58.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再来啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come again
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.63,0:51:00.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,废物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-for-nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.81,0:51:06.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经给你机会显示一下你的武功 我看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked you to demonstrate, what you know, and you did...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.31,0:51:08.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一点都不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a goddamn thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.58,0:51:13.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我要你以虎鹤拳 和我的鹰爪拳比试一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see your Tiger Crane, match my Eagle's Claw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.37,0:52:12.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和其他美国女人一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like all Yankee women...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.41,0:52:15.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只知道在餐馆点菜 花男人的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...all you can do is order in restaurants and spend a man's money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.05,0:52:18.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,痛吗? 我问你呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excruciating, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.75,0:52:20.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,痛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.59,0:52:22.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你相不相信我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it was my wish...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.42,0:52:24.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,随时能砍下你的手臂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I could chop your arm off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.82,0:52:26.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, please don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.56,0:52:29.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你相不相信我想怎样就怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my arm now. I can do what I please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.49,0:52:32.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不想我砍你的手...动手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can stop me, I suggest you try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.97,0:52:35.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.13,0:52:38.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打不过吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're helpless?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.24,0:52:40.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.77,0:52:44.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以前试过这种滋味吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever felt this before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.28,0:52:46.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.44,0:52:49.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的功夫和我比 简直是班门弄斧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compared to me, you're as helpless as a worm fighting an eagle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.75,0:52:51.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的!!!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}YES!!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.15,0:52:54.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}THAT'S THE BEGlNNlNG!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.66,0:53:03.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想不想学 我刚才和你打的这套拳?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it your wish to possess this kind of power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.00,0:53:07.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.17,0:53:10.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从明天开始你要练武{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your training will begin, tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.79,0:53:12.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.71,0:53:22.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的手臂属于我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since your arm now belongs to me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.98,0:53:24.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会将它练得结实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I want it strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.85,0:53:27.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能做到像我这样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.95,0:53:30.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以 不过还差你一节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can, but not that close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.79,0:53:32.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是不行了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you can't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.32,0:53:37.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果敌人离你的身体只有三寸...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if your enemy, is three inches in front of you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.16,0:53:39.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么对付他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...What do you do then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.56,0:53:41.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱头鼠窜...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Curl into a ball...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.33,0:53:44.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是用拳打穿他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or do you put your FlST through him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.17,0:53:46.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.17,0:54:20.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,练拳头不应该是你怕木头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the wood that should fear your hand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.77,0:54:23.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是木头怕你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not the other way around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.04,0:54:28.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你之所以打不穿木头  是因为你用手之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder you can't do it, you acquiesce to defeat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.38,0:54:29.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经认输了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before you even begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.29,0:56:20.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你像狗一样吃东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to eat like a dog...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.79,0:56:23.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就让你像狗一样住外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can live and sleep outside like a dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.30,0:56:28.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想像人一样的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to live and sleep like a human...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.80,0:56:31.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把筷子拿起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...pick up those sticks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.21,1:00:05.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 你混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.82,1:00:49.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 白眉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, Pai Mei.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.66,1:00:53.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.63,1:03:06.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请给我一杯水?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have a glass of water, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.43,1:03:12.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,[第九章：艾儿和我]
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.95,1:05:47.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 原来那就是德州式葬礼? - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sothat's a Texas funeral? - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.99,1:05:51.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不承认你还真行 巴德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to give it to ya, Budd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.36,1:05:54.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种死法还真凄惨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a pretty fucked up way to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.53,1:05:56.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她墓碑上是什么名字?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the name on the grave she's buried under?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.83,1:05:59.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宝菈...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paula...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.20,1:06:03.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,休兹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Schultz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.57,1:06:09.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能看看那把刀吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I look at the sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.04,1:06:13.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的钱就在那红箱子里 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my money right there in that red bag, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.68,1:06:16.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sure is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.45,1:06:18.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那好 刀是你的啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then, it's your sword now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.14,1:06:38.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 这就是那把半藏的刀咯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is a Hattori Hanzo sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.14,1:06:40.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚说啥?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that you said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.14,1:06:42.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是服部半藏铸的刀?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is a Hattori Hanzo sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.61,1:06:44.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就是半藏的刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a Hanzo sword, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.01,1:06:47.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔告诉我 你曾经也有一把他的刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill tells me you once had one of these of your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.35,1:06:51.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 曾经{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.42,1:06:54.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真的? 这把和那把比如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? How does this one compare to that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.30,1:07:06.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要拿半藏的刀去比...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're gonna compare a Hanzo sword...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.43,1:07:12.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么其他所有的刀...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you compare it to every other sword ever made{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.31,1:07:17.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都不是服部半藏铸的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wasn't made by Hattori Hanzo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.05,1:07:27.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给...大口喝吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go. Wrap your lips around that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.60,1:07:40.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.20,1:07:42.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么感受?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which "R" are you filled with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.47,1:07:45.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.04,1:07:50.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.14,1:07:57.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老人的头号杀手就是退休{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the number one killer... of old people... is retirement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.92,1:08:03.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们还有未竟的事 就得活得久一点去完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People got a job to do, they tend to live a little bit longer so they can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.53,1:08:07.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直认为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always figured that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.93,1:08:10.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战士和敌人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...warriors and their enemies...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.06,1:08:13.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有着同样的关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...share the same relationship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.80,1:08:19.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在战场上你没有敌人可杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now that you're not gonna have to face your enemy no more on the battlefield...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.47,1:08:23.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你是什么感受?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which "R" ya filled with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.28,1:08:27.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,轻松...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relief...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.88,1:08:31.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是婉惜?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or regret?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.35,1:08:37.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 都有点 - 放屁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A little bit of both. - Horseshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.96,1:08:41.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你两种感受都有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you do feel a little bit of both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.56,1:08:48.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我肯定其中一种比另以种多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I know damn well that you feel one more than you feel the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.43,1:08:52.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,问题是...哪个多点?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the question was: Which one is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.71,1:08:55.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,婉惜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.71,1:09:00.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道她早晚她会取代你的地位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you gotta hand it to the ol' girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.21,1:09:05.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没看过有谁 能像她那样使比尔着迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never saw anybody buffalo Bill the way she buffaloed Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.15,1:09:07.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔认为她很聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill thought she was so damn smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.32,1:09:09.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我试图告诉他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I tried to tell him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.76,1:09:11.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她只能算金发美女中比较聪明的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...she was just smart for a blond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.18,1:09:32.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a bunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.59,1:10:21.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦...对不起 巴德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Budd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.56,1:10:24.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我太失礼了 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was rude of me, wasn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.26,1:10:27.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴德 我给你介绍 这是我的朋友...黑曼巴蛇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Budd, I'd like to introduce my friend, the black mamba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.87,1:10:30.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是黑曼巴；这是巴德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black mamba, this is Budd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.94,1:10:33.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我选中这小东西之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, before I picked that little fella up,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.47,1:10:35.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在网上查过它的资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I looked him up on the lnternet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.81,1:10:39.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑曼巴真是个神奇的动物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating creature, the black mamba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.08,1:10:40.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听好咯:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.82,1:10:48.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"在非洲 是这么说的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"In Africa, the saying goes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.12,1:10:52.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在原野上 大象能要你的命 豹能要你的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the bush, an elephant can kill you, a leopard can kill you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.39,1:10:56.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑曼巴蛇也能要你的命 但是只有黑曼巴...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a black mamba can kill you. But only with the mamba,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.50,1:11:00.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自开天辟地以来 能确定让人致命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this has been true in Africa since the dawn of time, is death sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.00,1:11:06.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此它被认为是死神的化身" 很酷吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hence its handle, Death Incarnate." Pretty cool, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.24,1:11:13.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"它的神经性毒液是自然界中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Its neurotoxic venom is one of nature's most effective poisons,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.08,1:11:16.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毒性是最强的一种 能导致全身麻痹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}acting on the nervous system, causing paralysis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.48,1:11:20.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它毒液能使人在4小时内死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The venom of a black mamba can kill a human being in four hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.09,1:11:22.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过那是咬到脚踝或是拇指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if, say, bitten on the ankle or the thumb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.89,1:11:26.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然而 如果咬到脸或身体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, a bite to the face or torso{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.39,1:11:30.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,20分钟内就会从全身麻痹到死亡"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can bring death from paralysis within 20 minutes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.10,1:11:33.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在听好咯 因为和你有关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you should listen to this, 'cause this concerns you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.17,1:11:38.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"它咬一口所能释放出的毒液{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The amount of venom that can be delivered from a single bite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.07,1:11:41.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常巨量"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can be gargantuan."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.34,1:11:43.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都挺喜欢这个词:"巨量"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I've always liked that word, "gargantuan."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.98,1:11:46.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,平时说话很少有机会用得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I so rarely have an opportunity to use it in a sentence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.88,1:11:50.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"如果不即时用血清治疗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If not treated quickly with antivenom,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.32,1:11:53.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,10到15毫克就能致命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10 to 15 milligrams can be fatal to human beings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.22,1:11:55.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然而黑曼巴一口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, the black mamba can deliver{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.86,1:12:00.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就能放出100到400毫克的毒液"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as much as 100 to 400 milligrams of venom from a single bite."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.86,1:12:06.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.90,1:12:11.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你生命最后 几分钟的挣扎里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in these last agonizing minutes of life you have left,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.50,1:12:14.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我好好回答 你刚才提出的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iet me answer that question you asked earlier more thoroughly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.28,1:12:20.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,此时此刻...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right at this moment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.95,1:12:24.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我感受最深的是婉惜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the biggest "R" I feel is regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.35,1:12:32.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,婉惜我所遇到 或许是最伟大的战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regret that maybe the greatest warrior I have ever met{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.22,1:12:42.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会死在像你 这样卑鄙无耻小人的手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}met her end at the hands of a bushwhackin', scrub, alkie, piece of shit like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.27,1:12:46.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那女人应该死的更壮烈才对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That woman deserved better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.65,1:13:31.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.42,1:13:35.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个不幸的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I have some tragic news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.62,1:13:39.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brother's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.56,1:13:41.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真遗憾 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so sorry, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.50,1:13:44.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她在他住的活动屋里放了条黑曼巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She put a black mamba in his camper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.97,1:13:47.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我把事情解决了 她也死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got her, sweetie. She's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.00,1:13:52.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me put it this way:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.94,1:13:57.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你觉得很伤心 就去加州巴斯多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever start feeling sentimental, go to Barstow, California.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.34,1:14:01.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到了以后 去花店买一大束花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you get here, walk into a florist and buy a bunch of flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.31,1:14:04.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后带着花去杭廷顿公墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you take those flowers to Huntington Cemetery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.28,1:14:08.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再富乐和瓜达路培街交口 找一块叫做宝菈·休兹的墓碑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on Fuller and Guadalupe, look for the headstone marked "Paula Schultz,"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.72,1:14:10.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再把花放在墓上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lay them on the grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.79,1:14:16.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那儿就是你的小乖 碧翠丝·基多安息的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause you will be standing at the final resting place of Beatrix Kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.80,1:14:19.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛缇·克超瑟? - 在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marty Kitrosser? - Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.37,1:14:21.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 美洛妮·贺豪斯? - 在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Melanie Harrhouse? - Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.27,1:14:23.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 碧翠丝·基多? - 在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Beatrix Kiddo? - Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.80,1:14:27.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以四小时之内到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look... I can be there in about four hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.24,1:14:29.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我过去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want me to come over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.81,1:14:33.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不...不... 如果你要 宝贝 我立马过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no. You need me, baby, I'm there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.95,1:14:38.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我现在就出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. I'm leaving now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.82,1:14:41.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你先抽口大麻烟或什么的 我马上就到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go smoke some pot or somethin', I'll be there soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.45,1:15:46.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恶心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.07,1:17:13.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"献给我的弟弟 巴德 我唯一爱的人 比尔 "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"T o my brother, Budd. The only man I ever loved. Bill."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.33,1:17:28.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.10,1:17:32.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴德的半藏刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Budd's Hanzo sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.61,1:17:35.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说他拿去当了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he pawned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.17,1:17:38.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么他就是个骗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess that makes him a liar now, don't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.48,1:17:45.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾儿? - 碧(翠丝){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Elle? - Bea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.12,1:17:49.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有件事情我一直很好奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somethin' I've always been curious about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.26,1:17:52.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,算是咱们女孩间的秘密吧...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just between us girls...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.99,1:17:57.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对白眉说了什么 他居然戳瞎了你一只眼睛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what did you say to Pai Mei to make him snatch out your eye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.20,1:18:04.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我骂他可怜的老不死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I called him a miserable old fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.47,1:18:08.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 馊主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh. Bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.74,1:18:11.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜我干了啥?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know what I did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.11,1:18:15.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我宰了那可怜的老不死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed that miserable old fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.92,1:18:20.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,鱼头味道如何呀 可怜的老不死?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you like the fish head, you miserable old fool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.62,1:18:23.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在鱼头里下了毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I poisoned his fish heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.09,1:18:26.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾儿 你这条没人性的狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elle, you treacherous dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.16,1:18:33.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I-give-you-my-word...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.53,1:18:35.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I told him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.13,1:18:39.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"对我来说 你这老不死的话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To me, the word of an old fool like you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.10,1:18:43.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一文不值 "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is worth less than nothing."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.08,1:18:50.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.12,1:18:52.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我宰了你师父{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed your master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.15,1:18:54.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在还要杀你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I'm gonna kill you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.85,1:18:57.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就用你自己的刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With your own sword, no less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.59,1:19:03.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再过一会儿 就成了我的刀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which, in the very immediate future, will become my sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.03,1:19:08.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,婊子...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.17,1:19:10.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你马上就玩完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you don't have a future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.02,1:20:02.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,操你这婊子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.52,1:20:06.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,臭婊子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.40,1:20:17.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我宰了你! 你他妈的死定了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you! You're fuckin' dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.51,1:20:23.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这婊子! 你这婊子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bitch! You bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.85,1:20:29.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要宰了你 婊子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll fucking kill you, you bitch!{\r}
