Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.29,1:30:36.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉她 你在睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told her that you were asleep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.32,1:30:41.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但有一天你会醒来去找她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but that one day you'd wake up and come back to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.26,1:30:45.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她问我: 如果我出生时 妈咪就在睡觉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she asked me, "If Mommy's been asleep since I was born,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.56,1:30:48.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她如何知道我长什么样呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then how will she know what I look like?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.33,1:30:55.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我回答说: 因为妈咪一直梦见你啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To which I replied, "Because Mommy's been dreaming of you."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.97,1:30:58.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是这么说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.94,1:31:02.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有梦到我? 我有梦到你哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you dream of me? I dreamed of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.35,1:31:07.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每天晚上 宝贝! 每天晚上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every single night, baby. Every single night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.12,1:31:10.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我等你醒来等了好久 妈咪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I waited a long time for you to wake up, Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.33,1:31:24.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在让我看看你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let me look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.14,1:31:27.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.54,1:31:35.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 哇 哇  你真是个漂亮的小女生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My, my, my, what a pretty little girl you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.48,1:31:37.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也很漂亮 妈咪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're pretty too, Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.59,1:31:47.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉妈咪 我给你看她照片的时候 你怎么说的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Mommy what you said when I showed you her picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.39,1:31:51.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说啊 别害羞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, shy girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.13,1:31:53.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定记得的 快说啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You know what you said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.87,1:31:58.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快呀!告诉妈咪! 这会让她开心的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Tell Mommy. It'll make her feel good. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.20,1:32:00.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯嗯 - 对呀 快说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mnh-mnh. - Yeah. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.77,1:32:03.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说...我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said... I said,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.34,1:32:09.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"我说你是我见过这世界上 最美丽的女人 "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You're the most beautifulest woman I ever saw in the whole wide world."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.18,1:32:14.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 她是这么说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the truth. That's what she said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.65,1:32:21.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 你是不是认为 妈咪的头发是世界上最漂亮的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B.B., don't you think Mommy has the prettiest hair in the whole wide world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.83,1:32:25.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对啊 - 实际上 比漂亮更漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, I do. - Matter of fact, it's better than pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.10,1:32:31.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 比漂亮更漂亮 该怎么说? - 嗯...美丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's better than pretty? - Mmm... Gorgeous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.90,1:32:36.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了 美丽 妈咪很美丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good. Gorgeous. Mommy is gorgeous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.58,1:32:44.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 甜心... 妈咪有点生爹地的气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm. You know, sweetie, Mommy's kinda mad at Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.68,1:32:47.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?你是个坏爹地吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Daddy? Were you being a bad daddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.65,1:32:52.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕是的 我以前是个很坏的爹地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I was. I was a real bad daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.63,1:32:57.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的小女儿 某天学到了生死的涵义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our little girl learned about life and death the other day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.70,1:33:02.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉妈咪埃米利欧的事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna tell Mommy about what happened to Emilio?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.30,1:33:07.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.31,1:33:12.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 埃米利欧是她的金鱼 - 埃米利欧是我的金鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Emilio was her goldfish. - Emilio was my goldfiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.48,1:33:17.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她跑到我的房间 手里拿着金鱼 哭着说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She came running into my room, holding the fish in her hand and crying,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.22,1:33:20.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"爹地 爹地 埃米利欧死了 "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Daddy. Daddy. Emilio's dead."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.89,1:33:25.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说 "真的吗? 太令人伤心了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I said, "Really? That's so sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.02,1:33:28.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它是怎么死的?"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did he die?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.29,1:33:31.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么来着? - 我踩到它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And what did you say? - I stepped on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.46,1:33:36.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上 小宝贝 当时你很技巧的说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, young lady, the words you so strategically used were,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.77,1:33:40.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我"不小心"踩到它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I accidentally stepped on him."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.74,1:33:42.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就问她...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To which I queried,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.74,1:33:48.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"你的小脚怎么会 不小心踩到鱼缸里去了呢?"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And just how did your foot accidentally find its way into Emilio's fishbowl?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.31,1:33:52.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说 "不是...不是... 我是在地毯上踩到它的 "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she said, "No, no, no. Emilio was on the carpet when I stepped on him."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.65,1:33:56.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯...像是剧情的铺陈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm. The plot thickens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.65,1:34:01.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,埃米利欧到底是怎么 跑到地毯上的呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And just how did Emilio get on the carpet?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.63,1:34:04.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈咪 你会为她感到非常骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Mommy, you would've been so proud of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.43,1:34:09.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她没有说谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.53,1:34:13.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说她把埃米利欧 从鱼缸拿出来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said she took Emilio out of his bowl...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.77,1:34:17.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放到地毯上的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and put him on the carpet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.84,1:34:22.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,埃米利欧在地毯上干嘛呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what was Emilio doing on the carpet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.98,1:34:24.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一直跳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flapping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.92,1:34:29.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 然后你就踩到它了? - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And then you stomped on him. - Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.79,1:34:33.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把脚移开时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when you lifted up your foot...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.66,1:34:37.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- ...埃米利欧在做什么? - 什么也没做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...what was Emilio doing then? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.80,1:34:40.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它不跳了 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stopped flapping, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.07,1:34:45.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后来她告诉我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She told me later...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.60,1:34:47.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当她移开脚时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that the second she lifted up her foot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.97,1:34:52.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看见埃米利欧不跳了的时候 她就明白自己做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and saw Emilio not flapping, she knew what she had done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.28,1:34:57.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不正是一幅生死交织 完美的画面吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that not the perfect visual image of life and death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.45,1:35:02.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地毯上跳动的金鱼 和地毯上不动的金鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fish flapping on the carpet, and a fish not flapping on the carpet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.76,1:35:13.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么强烈的感觉 即使一个对生死 完全没概念的4岁孩子都懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So powerful, even a four-year-old with no concept of life or death knew what it meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.23,1:35:17.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你爱埃米利欧 是吗? - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You loved Emilio, didn't you? - Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.40,1:35:20.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么...我也爱妈咪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... I love Mommy, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.81,1:35:24.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我对妈咪做了一件 和你对埃米利欧做的同样的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I did to Mommy what you did to Emilio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.11,1:35:28.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你踩了妈咪? - 更糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You stomped on Mommy? - Worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.15,1:35:30.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我开枪打了妈咪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shot Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.32,1:35:33.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是像我们刚才那样玩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not pretend shooting like we were just doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.55,1:35:35.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的用枪打了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shot her for real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.29,1:35:37.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么? 你是想知道会发生什么是吗??{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Did you want to see what would happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.82,1:35:42.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 我知道开枪打她 会有怎样的结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I knew what would happen to Mommy if I shot her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.63,1:35:47.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不知道我打了妈咪以后 自己会怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I didn't know was, when I shot Mommy, what would happen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.20,1:35:50.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 后来怎样? - 我很伤心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - I was very sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.20,1:35:55.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以那时我学到了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's when I learned...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.51,1:36:00.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些事做了以后 就无法再改变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...some things, once you do, they can never be undone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.82,1:36:08.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 妈咪后来怎么样了? - 你怎么不问妈咪呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to Mommy? - Why don't you ask Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.02,1:36:12.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈咪 你没事吧? 疼不疼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You OK, Mommy? Did it hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.26,1:36:15.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不疼 甜心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.03,1:36:18.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不再疼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't hurt anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.07,1:36:26.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会使你生病吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did it make you sick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.41,1:36:31.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会 我只是让我睡着了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It made me sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.81,1:36:34.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有没能陪你 我在睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I haven't been with you, B.B. I've been asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.58,1:36:38.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你现在醒了 对吧 妈咪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're awake now, Mommy. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.38,1:36:41.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我全醒了 小美人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm wide awake, pretty girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.59,1:36:46.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 你要妈咪睡前 陪你看录相片吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B.B., would you like Mommy to watch a video with you before sleepy time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.92,1:36:48.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.46,1:36:52.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈咪 你愿意陪我 在睡前看录相片吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy, do you wanna watch a video with me before sleepy time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.30,1:36:54.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 当然 我愿意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah! I would love to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.07,1:36:57.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要看哪一片呢? - 幕府杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which one do you wanna watch? - Shogun Assassin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.94,1:37:00.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不好 宝贝 那片子太长了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, B.B. Shogun Assassin is too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.37,1:37:04.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯 - 不长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mnh-mnh. - No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.51,1:37:08.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧 小姐们 我失陪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, I'll leave you ladies to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.69,1:37:21.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候 我爸爸很有名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was little, my father was famous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.13,1:37:25.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是全帝国最好的武士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was the greatest samurai in the empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.53,1:37:28.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是幕府将军的刽子手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he was the shogun's decapitator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.90,1:37:34.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,曾经砍掉131个诸侯的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He cut off the heads of 131 lords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.24,1:37:41.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我爸爸回到家看见妈妈时 他就会忘记那些杀戮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father would come home to Mother and when he would see her, he would forget about the killings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.55,1:37:46.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不怕将军 将军却怕他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't scared of the shogun, but the shogun was scared of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.78,1:37:49.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许那就是问题所在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that was the problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.55,1:37:52.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一天晚上... 将军派出了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One night, the shogun sent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.49,1:37:57.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.13,1:40:17.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在欣赏你的刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just admiring your sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.10,1:40:20.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是把好刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite a piece of work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.71,1:40:24.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说到这儿...半藏最近如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of which, how is Hanzo-san?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.48,1:40:26.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.01,1:40:31.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的寿司愈做愈好了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has his sushi gotten any better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.12,1:40:39.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我简直难以相信 他居然替你铸刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I couldn't believe it. You got him to make you a sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.99,1:40:44.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其实很简单 我只是提到了你的名字 比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was easy. I just dropped your name, Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.33,1:40:46.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈...那就够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.70,1:41:22.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们该用 半藏的刀来交手 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose the idea is we cross Hanzo swords. Am I right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.97,1:41:26.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.67,1:41:31.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正巧这个庄园有片私人海滩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it just so happens this hacienda has its own private beach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.98,1:41:38.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,海滩沐浴在月光下 显得特别的非常美丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that private beach just so happens to look particularly beautiful bathed in moonlight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.32,1:41:42.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天碰巧又是满月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there just so happens to be a full moon out tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.19,1:41:48.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你愿意咱们就 去海滩用刀决斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, swordfighter, if you want a swordfight, that's where I suggest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.59,1:41:53.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果你想用传统的方式...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you wanna be old school about it..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.30,1:41:56.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是最传统的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you know I'm all about old school...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.00,1:42:00.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就等到天亮后 再像正统武士道一般对决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then we could wait until dawn and slice each other up at sunrise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.84,1:42:03.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像一对真的夫妻似的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iike a couple of real-life honest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.38,1:42:10.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在...如果你不冷静一下 我就在你膝盖上来一枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you don't settle down, I'm gonna have to put one in your kneecap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.57,1:42:13.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听说这样会痛的要命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I hear tell that's a very painful place to get shot in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.97,1:42:19.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈哈  我只是跟你闹着玩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just fuckin' with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.58,1:42:23.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.78,1:42:26.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至于你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when it comes to you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.42,1:42:28.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至于我们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.02,1:42:33.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有些不明白的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I have a few unanswered questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.26,1:42:39.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这个血腥的复仇故事 达到最高潮之前...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, before this tale of bloody revenge reaches its climax,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.80,1:42:45.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要问你几个问题 你得照实回答我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna ask you some questions, and I want you to tell me the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.14,1:42:49.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然而...这也有矛盾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, therein lies a dilemma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.44,1:42:57.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为一谈到我 我相信你不能也不会对我说实话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because when it comes to the subject of me,\NI believe you are truly and utterly incapable of telling the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.45,1:43:01.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特别是对我 甚至你不愿意对自己说实话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially to me. And least of all, to yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.92,1:43:05.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同时...只要一谈到我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when it comes to the subject of me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.49,1:43:12.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能也不会相信你所说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am truly and utterly incapable of believing anything you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.36,1:43:14.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为该怎么解决这个矛盾?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you suppose we solve this dilemma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.47,1:43:16.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.30,1:43:18.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我突然想到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it just so happens,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.37,1:43:20.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个解决办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a solution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.57,1:43:23.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 啊! - 打中了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aah! - Gotcha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.07,1:43:25.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.75,1:43:31.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的 你用什么射我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck did you just shoot me with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.22,1:43:34.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我最伟大的发明 起码是我最喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My greatest invention. Or at least my favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.72,1:43:38.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰它 不然我会在 你脸夹上再来一枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch it, or I'll stick another one right in your cheek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.33,1:43:49.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你中的子弹里有一种物质 现正开始在你血管里流窜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What lies within that dart, just begging to course its way through your veins...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.67,1:43:54.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是一种非常强而有效的麻醉剂 它能让人说实话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is an incredibly potent and quite infallible truth serum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.27,1:43:57.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我称它做"毋庸怀疑的事实"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call it "The Undisputed Truth."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.47,1:44:02.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比有钠成分的麻醉剂还要强两倍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twice as strong as sodium pentothal, with no druggie aftereffects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.05,1:44:08.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了会让你有点儿快感之外 没有其他副作用 感觉到了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for a slight wave of euphoria. You feel it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.85,1:44:11.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快感? - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Euphoria? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.92,1:44:14.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 真糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Too bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.03,1:44:18.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.40,1:44:21.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢漫画{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm quite keen on comic books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.67,1:44:25.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特别是那些关于超级大英雄的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially the ones about superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.60,1:44:31.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对那些英雄式的神话非常着迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find the whole mythology surrounding superheroes fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.24,1:44:35.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿我最喜欢的超人为例吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take my favorite superhero, Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.91,1:44:38.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不算好漫画 也画的不好...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a great comic book. Not particularly well-drawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.62,1:44:42.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.39,1:44:44.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但就神话上的意义来说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the mythology...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.86,1:44:48.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不仅伟大 而且是独一无二的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mythology is not only great, it's unique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.29,1:44:52.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这捞什子的药性多久会发作?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long does this shit take to go into effect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.63,1:44:56.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大约两分钟吧 正好够我讲完重点了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About two minutes. Just long enough for me to finish my point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.63,1:45:04.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,英雄式的神话中都有个特点 他们同时是英雄也是凡人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, a staple of the superhero mythology is, there's the superhero and there's the alter ego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.01,1:45:09.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠侠原来是布鲁斯·伟恩 蜘蛛侠原来是彼得·派克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Batman is actually Bruce Wayne, Spider-Man is actually Peter Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.41,1:45:14.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当蜘蛛侠早上醒来 他是彼得·派克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When that character wakes up in the morning, he's Peter Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.32,1:45:19.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他得穿上蜘蛛服才会变成蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has to put on a costume to become Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.56,1:45:25.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从这个观点来说 超人是更出众的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it is in that characteristic Superman stands alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.46,1:45:28.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是后来变成超人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman didn't become Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.37,1:45:31.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而是天生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman was born Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.14,1:45:35.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,超人早上醒来 他就是个超人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Superman wakes up in the morning, he's Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.54,1:45:38.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的凡人面是克拉克·肯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His alter ego is Clark Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.08,1:45:42.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他衣服上的大红"S"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His outfit with the big red "S"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.31,1:45:45.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是当他父母 发现他时 原本就在包着他的毛毯上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's the blanket he was wrapped in as a baby when the Kents found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.05,1:45:48.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是他自己的衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are his clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.99,1:45:58.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至于眼镜和西装 只是他 为了要融入凡人社会中而穿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What Kent wears, the glasses, the business suit, that's the costume. That's the costume Superman wears to blend in with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.53,1:46:03.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克拉克·肯特只是 超人眼中我们的化身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark Kent is how Superman views us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.07,1:46:07.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至于克拉克·肯特的个性...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what are the characteristics of Clark Kent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.40,1:46:09.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他软弱...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's weak...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.81,1:46:12.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,缺乏自信...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he's unsure of himself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.74,1:46:14.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个懦夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he's a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.51,1:46:20.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克拉克·肯特是超人 对全人类的所下的定义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark Kent is Superman's critique on the whole human race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.22,1:46:26.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有点儿像碧翠丝·基多和 汤米·普林顿的夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorta like Beatrix Kiddo and Mrs. Tommy Plimpton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.16,1:46:30.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aso.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.46,1:46:32.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总算你说出了重点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The point emerges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.36,1:46:37.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你原本可以成维爱琳·普林顿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would've worn the costume of Arlene Plimpton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.97,1:46:41.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你生来就是碧翠丝·基多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you were born Beatrix Kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.81,1:46:46.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你每天早上醒来 还是碧翠丝基多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every morning when you woke up, you'd still be Beatrix Kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.84,1:46:49.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把针头拔出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you can... take the needle out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.35,1:46:58.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫我超级英雄?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you calling me a superhero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.69,1:47:00.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你杀手...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm calling you a killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.96,1:47:03.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天生的杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A natural born killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.93,1:47:07.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直都是...以后永远都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always have been, and you always will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.63,1:47:09.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搬去艾帕索...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moving to El Paso...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.93,1:47:13.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,二手唱片行打工...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...working in a used record store...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.40,1:47:15.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和汤米一起去看电影...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...goin' to the movies with Tommy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.01,1:47:17.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,收集折价券{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...clipping coupons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.57,1:47:19.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那只不过是你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.48,1:47:22.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想伪装成工蜂...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...trying to disguise yourself as a worker bee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.05,1:47:26.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,躲在蜂巢里不被发现罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's you tryin' to blend in with the hive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.15,1:47:28.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不是工蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're not a worker bee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.55,1:47:32.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是变节的杀人蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a renegade killer bee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.46,1:47:35.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你喝多少啤酒 吃过多少烤肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no matter how much beer you drank or barbecue you ate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.33,1:47:38.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或是你的屁股变得多肥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or how fat your ass got,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.70,1:47:42.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,世上一切都不能改变这个事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing in the world would ever change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.00,1:47:47.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一个问题:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First question:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.24,1:47:54.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的认为 从此能在艾帕索 过个普通人的生活吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you really think your life in El Paso was gonna work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.32,1:48:02.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.46,1:48:08.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但宝贝本来是我的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I would've had B.B.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.56,1:48:11.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别误会我的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get me wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.33,1:48:15.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你本来就会是个好母亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you would have been a wonderful mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.30,1:48:17.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你也是个杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you are a killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.97,1:48:24.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能找到我之前所杀的那些人 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those people you killed to get to me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.81,1:48:27.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也都是高手 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...felt damn good, didn't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.45,1:48:31.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.98,1:48:34.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每一个人都是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every single one of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.56,1:48:46.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.63,1:48:52.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是给你暖身的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the warmup round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.30,1:48:57.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在到了要问你 值六万四千美元的问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now comes the $64,000 question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.35,1:49:07.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要离开我 还怀着我的骨肉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you run away from me with my baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.79,1:49:15.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得你派给我的最后一个任务吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember the last assignment you sent me on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.29,1:49:17.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.79,1:49:19.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,王丽莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lisa Wong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.16,1:49:23.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出发的那天早上 我病了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The morning I left, I was sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.40,1:49:28.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在飞机上吐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the plane, I threw up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.87,1:49:33.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我开始想:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I started thinking:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.81,1:49:35.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能是怀孕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I was pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.05,1:49:40.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,使用方便 打开盖子 将尿液浸泡5分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Easy to use. Remove cap and urinate on the absorbent end for five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.69,1:49:48.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要90秒 小窗口上 就会显示正确结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Accurate results in only 90 seconds. You can read the results as soon as the line appears in the window."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.13,1:50:26.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.23,1:50:28.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I didn't know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.47,1:50:32.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,旅途中我的踪迹已经败露{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was that somewhere on my journey I had been spotted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.60,1:50:38.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我到了洛杉矶不久 王丽莎就派出了杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With me in L.A., it didn't take Lisa Wong long to send an assassin of her own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.78,1:50:41.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈啰 有事儿吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.58,1:50:44.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈啰 我是金凯伦饭 诚志饭店的客服经理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, I'm Karen Kim. I'm the hospitality manager of the hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.98,1:50:46.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有个见面礼给您{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a welcome gift from the management.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.85,1:50:50.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真周到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's nice. Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.12,1:50:52.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,留在门下就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you just leave it by the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.60,1:51:07.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你很会使长枪吗? - 不是非得这么近我能才打中你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You pretty good with that shotgun? - Not that I have to be at this range,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.87,1:51:09.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是个使枪老手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm a fuckin' surgeon with this shotgun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.84,1:51:12.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你吧 婊子 我比神枪手 奥克丽还准 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, guess what, bitch? I'm better than Annie Oakley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.98,1:51:16.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在我射程内 - 我能把你的猪脑袋轰掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I got you right in my sight. - I could blow your fuckin' head off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.45,1:51:20.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会比我打中你的眉心快 咱们还是谈谈吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not before I put one right between your eyes, so let's talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.29,1:51:24.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凯伦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.39,1:51:28.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚发现...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I just found out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.79,1:51:30.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...right now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.83,1:51:36.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在你刚破门而入后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not a moment before you blew a hole through the door...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.87,1:51:39.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- ...我怀孕了 - 说这干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...that I'm pregnant. - What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.24,1:51:44.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,门边的地上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the floor by the door...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.14,1:51:47.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有个验孕器 上面显示我怀孕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is a strip that says I'm pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.34,1:51:48.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胡扯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.78,1:51:53.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,换做别时 你一定没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any other time you'd be 100 percent right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.52,1:51:56.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但这次...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.45,1:51:58.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你完全错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're 100 percent wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.02,1:52:04.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是世上能要人命的女人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the deadliest woman in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.69,1:52:06.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But right now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.96,1:52:09.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有了孩子我却怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm just scared shitless for my baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.20,1:52:12.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.30,1:52:15.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看一下验孕器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just look at the strip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.77,1:52:19.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.81,1:52:25.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,待在原地别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay where you are and don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.73,1:52:45.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的 我不懂这表示啥?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what this fuckin' shit means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.17,1:52:47.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说明就在盒子上啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The box with the directions it's right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.32,1:53:01.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,使用方便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Easy to use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.08,1:53:05.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开盖子 将尿液浸泡海绵处5分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remove the cap and urinate on the absorbent end."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.72,1:53:07.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蓝色代表怀孕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blue means pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.19,1:53:10.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己会读 不用你多事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll read it myself, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.07,1:53:20.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.07,1:53:22.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 如果我相信你 下面该怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say I were to believe you. What then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.37,1:53:25.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你回家吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.11,1:53:28.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.80,1:53:49.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.07,1:53:55.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在验孕器变蓝色前...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before that strip turned blue...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.94,1:53:59.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个女人 我是你的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I was a woman, I was your woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.44,1:54:03.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的杀手...为你而杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a killer who killed for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.08,1:54:06.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在验孕器变成蓝色前 我愿意从摩托车上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before that strip turned blue, I would've jumped a motorcycle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.25,1:54:09.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跳到高速飞驰的火车上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}onto a speeding train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.32,1:54:11.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.62,1:54:15.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦验孕器变蓝色以后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But once that strip turned blue...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.06,1:54:19.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也无法做那些事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I could no longer do any of those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.63,1:54:22.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再也不能了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.17,1:54:24.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我要做妈妈了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I was gonna be a mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.84,1:54:29.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能了解吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you understand that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.68,1:54:35.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.35,1:54:37.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你为什么不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why didn't you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.58,1:54:40.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当时告诉我 反而是现在?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tell me then, instead of now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.82,1:54:43.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一旦知道 她就是你的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you knew, you'd claim her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.19,1:54:45.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I didn't want that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.93,1:54:48.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你能决定的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not your decision to make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.23,1:54:50.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.43,1:54:54.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我为我女儿所做的正确决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's the right decision, and I made it for my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.77,1:54:59.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她来到的世界应该是清白的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She deserved to be born with a clean slate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.51,1:55:01.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是和你在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But with you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.58,1:55:05.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她就会生在一个她不该在的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...she would've been born into a world she shouldn't have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.21,1:55:10.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须作选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.48,1:55:12.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我选择了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I chose her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.06,1:55:17.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道...如果5年前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, five years ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.92,1:55:22.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要我列出绝不可能发生事情的清单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I had to make a list of impossible things that could never happen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.86,1:55:28.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在我的脑壳上来一枪...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you performing a coup de grace on me by bustin' a cap in my crown...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.90,1:55:33.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对会排在第一位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would've been right at the top of the list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.24,1:55:37.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我错了 不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd have been wrong, wouldn't l?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.58,1:55:40.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I-I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.58,1:55:42.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个问我的问题吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that a question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.95,1:55:49.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果说你认为那是不可能发生的事 这样说的话 你是错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of impossible things that could never happen, yes, in this instance, you would've been wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.79,1:55:51.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.86,1:55:55.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你没回来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you never came back,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.63,1:56:01.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我当然会想到王丽莎 或者其他什么人杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I naturally assumed Lisa Wong, or somebody else, had killed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.87,1:56:05.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 说正格儿的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! And for the record...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.17,1:56:09.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没死 却让爱你的人误会你死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Ietting somebody think somebody they love is dead when they're not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.44,1:56:11.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是非常残酷的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is quite cruel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.85,1:56:18.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为你伤心了三个月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mourned you for three months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.52,1:56:23.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我痛苦的第三个月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in the third month of mourning you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.96,1:56:26.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现了你的踪迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I tracked you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.39,1:56:28.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是故意要去追查你的行踪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't tryin' to track you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.60,1:56:34.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而是在追查 是找哪个混蛋杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was tryin' to track down the fucking assholes I thought killed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.10,1:56:37.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结果我却找到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I find you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.67,1:56:39.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结果我发现什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and what do I find?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.94,1:56:43.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不仅没死...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only are you not dead...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.34,1:56:47.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还要嫁给一个该死的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're getting married to some fucking jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.72,1:56:52.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你还怀孕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.56,1:56:57.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我...反应过度了些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I overreacted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.57,1:57:10.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,反应过度? 这就是你的解释?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You overreacted? Is that your explanation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.44,1:57:12.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没说我要解释什么!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say I was gonna explain myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.94,1:57:15.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是要告诉你实话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I was gonna tell you the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.94,1:57:19.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我说的太复杂 我就再说明白点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if that's too cryptic, let's get literal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.35,1:57:24.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.92,1:57:27.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个杀人的混蛋...你是知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a murdering bastard. You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.42,1:57:35.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你伤了这个混蛋的心 就会有很严重的后果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there are consequences to breaking the heart of a murdering bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.80,1:57:38.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这你也曾经历过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You experienced some of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.87,1:57:45.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的反应真的 那么出乎你的预料吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was my reaction really that surprising?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.54,1:57:49.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的...没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. It was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.64,1:57:55.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真能做出那种事吗...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you do what you did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.48,1:57:59.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你当然能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.29,1:58:05.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可我没想到你居然忍心那样对我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I never thought you would, or could, do that to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.79,1:58:08.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉 小乖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really sorry, Kiddo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.90,1:58:11.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你想错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but you thought wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.30,1:58:21.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你我之间还有未了结的账{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I have unfinished business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.31,1:58:25.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝...我知道你不是在开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby... you ain't kiddin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.68,1:59:04.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,白眉真的教你五指穿心掌?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pai Mei taught you the Five-Point-Palm Exploding-Heart Technique?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.25,1:59:09.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Course he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.29,1:59:13.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不告诉我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.20,1:59:19.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.67,1:59:24.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.67,1:59:27.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是个坏人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a bad person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.84,1:59:29.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.38,1:59:34.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是坏人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a bad person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.51,1:59:37.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个了不起的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a terrific person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.58,1:59:40.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我最喜欢的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my favorite person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.99,1:59:45.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但偶尔...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But every once in a while...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.96,1:59:47.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还真像个婊子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you can be a real cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.45,2:00:09.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我气色如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.17,2:00:28.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你像已经准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.12,2:02:14.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(第二天早晨)
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.21,2:02:18.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,呵呵呵 像朵"小"花吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well. If it ain't the little flower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.52,2:02:26.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美国人民大家晚安 一切就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}(narrator) Good evening, Mr. and Mrs. America and all the ships at sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.95,2:02:28.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在报导新闻 打开闪光灯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go to press. Flash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.02,2:02:31.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你家里有喜鹊吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a magpie in your home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.82,2:02:34.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有 那你是最幸运的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do, you are most fortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.26,2:02:37.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喜鹊是全世界最迷人的鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The magpie is the most charming bird in all the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.00,2:02:40.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也是农夫们最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the best friend a farmer ever had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.53,2:02:43.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对他要温柔 对他要仁慈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treat him gently. Treat him kindly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.67,2:02:48.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,永远记住...喜鹊值得你尊敬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And always remember, the magpie deserves your respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.18,2:03:26.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.71,2:03:30.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.75,2:03:32.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.32,2:03:37.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我要告诉你 我要做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I'll tell you what I'm gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.26,2:03:39.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我头不疼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't got no headache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.96,2:03:42.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 你当然头疼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes you have, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.21,2:16:49.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开拍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, action!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.95,2:16:54.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.22,2:16:56.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 拜托 再来一次吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on. Let's do it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.14,0:24:18.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮曾经多少次∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮How many times∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.47,0:24:23.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮你听人说过∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮Have you heard someone say∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.94,0:24:27.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮如果我像他一样富有∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮"If I had his money∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:31.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮就能做我想做的事∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮I could do things my way∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.48,0:24:35.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮但他们却不知∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮But little they know∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.35,0:24:39.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮很难找出∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮That it's so hard to find∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:42.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮十个富人中∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮One rich man in ten∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.96,0:24:47.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮有一个知足的人∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮With a satisfied mind∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.00,0:24:52.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮我也曾拥有∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮Once I was wading∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.57,0:24:56.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮财富与名望∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮In fortune and fame∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.38,0:25:00.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮所有我梦想的一切∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮Everything that I dreamed for∮{\r}
